    {
      "id": "MJUe",
      "code_hash": "71b72aa136860946780b208cb6f42bdc",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"massive-higgs-decays\">Massive Higgs decays</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><a href=\"/\">Browse all notebooks</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"/?file=hep/z_decay.py\">Chiral Z decays</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Generate <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(H\\to f\\bar f||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(H\\to W^-W^+||)</marimo-tex> or <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(H\\to ZZ||)</marimo-tex> from the Standard\nModel, retaining the final-particle masses. The calculation sums final spins\nand colors, including all three physical polarizations of each massive vector.\nA scalar Higgs needs no initial spin average.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">These are <strong>on-shell two-body decays above threshold</strong>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m_H&gt;2m_f||)</marimo-tex> or\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m_H&gt;2m_V||)</marimo-tex>. The <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(WW||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(ZZ||)</marimo-tex> results describe a Higgs above those thresholds;\nthey do not describe the off-shell <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(WW^*||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(ZZ^*||)</marimo-tex> decays at 125 GeV.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The reference results are FeynCalc's\n<a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/EW/Tree/H-FFbar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fermion</a>,\n<a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/EW/Tree/H-WW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WW</a>, and\n<a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/EW/Tree/H-ZZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ZZ</a> examples.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "e4297a8719b83d3d70d062f23e264bcb",
      "outputs": [
