          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Total decay width</strong> in terms of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(M=m_H||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\beta||)</marimo-tex>, with <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m^2=M^2(1-\\beta^2)/4||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/32\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>3\u00b7alpha\u00b7M\u00b7beta-2\u00b7alpha\u00b7M\u00b7beta\u00b3+3\u00b7alpha\u00b7M\u00b7beta\u2075<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\n    /<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>sw\u00b2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+sw<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+beta<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1+sw<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1+beta<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eThe generated massive squared amplitude and integrated decay width agree with the FeynCalc reference.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
